<view class="page" style="font-size:{{fontPx}}px"><view class="back" bindtap="back">‹ 返回</view><view class="title">我的私有知识库</view><view class="notice">平台底层知识与系统提示词不开放下载。这里保存你有权使用的门店或厂家资料，不与其他主体串库；未经授权不会自动用于公共训练。</view><view class="panel"><view class="field"><text class="field-label">标题</text><input value="{{title}}" data-field="title" bindinput="input" placeholder="如本店客群和服务约定"/></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">内容</text><textarea maxlength="-1" value="{{body}}" data-field="body" bindinput="input" placeholder="明确来源、适用范围与日期"/></view><button class="primary full-btn" bindtap="save" loading="{{busy}}">保存私有知识</button></view><view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view><view class="notice" wx:if="{{notice}}">{{notice}}</view><view class="panel" wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id"><view class="between"><text class="card-title">{{item.title}}</text><text class="badge">{{item.scope||'私有'}}</text></view><view class="line-text" style="margin-top:14rpx">{{item.body}}</view><button class="full-btn" bindtap="remove" data-id="{{item.id}}">移除本条知识</button></view><view class="empty" wx:if="{{!items.length}}">可先添加自己的经营事实和服务约定。</view></view>
